{"schema":1,"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.AdditiveValuationNorms.ABoundOfDescends:30:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.PropA.Descends.eq_twLen","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/AdditiveValuationNorms/ABoundOfDescends.lean","lines":[30,34],"atlasRow":385691,"chapter":"1.5992","archiveCommit":"40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005","provenance":{"fileSha256":"30d198e1610fb4ce9152eec6d4baa3c1bfd5ac30c3e9fdc7fa33a4d4445b09e6","commandSha256":"a2b9e4266a6a858951fde83a23d15d9f691e2cffaa202722aa5b8b286e9f736e"},"source":["theorem Descends.eq_twLen {γ : G L₀ (AlgebraicClosure L₀)} (h : Descends l L₀ γ) {e : ℕ} (he : 1 ≤ e) {m : ℕ} {L₁ : Type}","    [Field L₁] [NumberField L₁] [Algebra L₀ L₁] (hL : IsLayer l m L₀ L₁) :","    shaInv L₁ l e = twLen (xRep l l (⊤ : Subgroup (G L₀ (AlgebraicClosure L₀))) γ) (cycZ L₀ _ l γ : ℤ_[l]) e m := by","  rw [h e he m L₁ hL, xTw_apply, zpow_natCast, Units.val_pow_eq_pow_val]","  rfl"],"statementLines":[30,32],"proofLines":[32,34],"assume":["Assume `Descends l L₀ γ` (h).","Assume `1 ≤ e` (he).","Assume `IsLayer l m L₀ L₁` (hL)."],"show":"Fix a prime ℓ and a number field L₀. Suppose γ in the absolute Galois group of L₀ satisfies descent. For every natural e ≥ 1, every natural m, and every number field L₁ over L₀ satisfying IsLayer(ℓ,m,L₀,L₁), one has shaInv(L₁,ℓ,e) = twLen(A,χℓ(γ),e,m). Here A is the action of γ under xRep for the full absolute Galois group, and the cyclotomic unit χℓ(γ) is viewed in ℤℓ.","strategy":"Expand the twisted representation in the descent identity.","steps":[{"id":"g-32-115","number":"⟨1⟩1","kind":"rewrite","claim":"For e ≥ 1 and the mth layer L₁, descent expresses the cohomological invariant as the cokernel length of the ℓᵐ-th power of the twisted action minus the identity. Write T for the untwisted action of γ and u for the ℓ-adic integer underlying χℓ(γ). The twist acts by uᵉT because passing from a unit to its underlying integer commutes with natural powers. This gives exactly the operator defining the twisted cokernel length at (e,m).","lines":[32,34],"headLines":[32,34],"snippet":"    shaInv L₁ l e = twLen (xRep l l (⊤ : Subgroup (G L₀ (AlgebraicClosure L₀))) γ) (cycZ L₀ _ l γ : ℤ_[l]) e m := by\n  rw [h e he m L₁ hL, xTw_apply, zpow_natCast, Units.val_pow_eq_pow_val]\n  rfl","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:63:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.xTw_apply","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[63,64],"atlasRow":412316,"owner":"1.6879"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]}],"uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.AdditiveValuationNorms.ABoundOfDescends:16:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.PropA.Descends","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/AdditiveValuationNorms/ABoundOfDescends.lean","lines":[16,18],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.5992"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.AdditiveValuationNorms.CokLenLeOfRangeLe:26:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.PropA.twLen","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/AdditiveValuationNorms/CokLenLeOfRangeLe.lean","lines":[26,26],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.5992"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.GaloisCohomologyLength.LevelInertiaLeLevelDec:70:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.LDataCardLeFinrank.shaInv","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/GaloisCohomologyLength/LevelInertiaLeLevelDec.lean","lines":[70,71],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6283"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.KummerTheory.Mk0IdMapCongr:195:8","name":"UpperTheory.V.Kum.Dinf","kind":"abbrev","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/KummerTheory/Mk0IdMapCongr.le